1. Copy whole of wanted file
2. Go to Jets Mod Tool
3. Enable custom map tool
4. Paste file in Map SVG
5. Remember to set the Election PK
6. Click load map
7. Adjust X, Y and their offsets if required
8. Rename states if required
9. Enjoy your map :D
10. Remember to credit! u/UnpledgedElector

IMPORTANT!
These maps were tested by using StrawberryMaster's fork of Jets mod tool, and due to differences in how this and the original site translate map SVG's into TCT versions, using the original site may not work for some of them.
